<title>HONG KONG: S.China Industries interim net up 15 pct.</title>
<headline>S.China Industries interim net up 15 pct.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-09-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months ended June 30</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	   4.7    vs 4.1</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)    3.0    vs 2.5</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  nil    vs nil</p>
<p>    Net			    25.14  vs 21.83</p>
<p>    Turnover		     639.35 vs 532.06</p>
<p>    Company name		 South China Industries Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  October 10-11</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   October 23</p>
<p>NOTE - South China Industries is a maker of toys, hair care products and shoes.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6368</p>
